{"name":"The Net Key","slug":"glyph-net-key","blurb":"On the voice street, West carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Net. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Net Key.","seal":"11b5c1fc40d5911acb8a9081ae21da1c72d2df0b76c47454de31bc90c08fa8cc"}
